{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261027/photo/bkn-20261027230041917-1027_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261027230639\"/><p>涉嫌非禮男子被帶走扣查。</p><p>前日(25日)執法部門接報，指一名男子在港鐵青衣站內非禮一名女子後，逃去無蹤。經深入調查和翻查大量閉路電視，成功鎖定一名涉案男子。今日(27日)採取行動，在青衣城巴士總站，以涉嫌「非禮」拘拘捕一名56歲本地男子，他現正被扣留作進一步調查。</p><p>該部門表示，「非禮」屬嚴重罪行！一經定罪，最高可被判處監禁10年。市民切勿因一時衝動而以身試法。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T15:41:40.744599+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T15:00:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T15:58:15.488693+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:25.108188+00:00","content_hash":"0300a94992bb1183ca4a4b8ec8ae64cfcc2c952ed1dba021bf03e39cafb673f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T15:41:40.744599+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}